        "description": "<p>Your rights under Belgian and EU law, together with the promises Karmicare adds on top.</p>",
        "company_info": "<p>KARMICA BV, trading as KARMICARE · Vizierstraat 28, 8000 Bruges, Belgium · VAT BE 0676.972.896 · EORI BE0676972896</p>",
        "company_last_updated": "<p><a href=\"mailto:care@karmicare.com\" title=\"mailto:care@karmicare.com\">care@karmicare.com</a> · Last updated October 2026</p>",
